---
---
<div class="calculator" data-calculator data-kind="cooling"><form class="card" novalidate><h2>Datos de la estancia</h2><div class="fields">
<div><label for="area">Superficie</label><div class="input-wrap"><input id="area" name="area" value="30" inputmode="decimal" aria-describedby="area-error"/><span>m²</span></div><span class="error" id="area-error"></span></div>
<div><label for="height">Altura</label><div class="input-wrap"><input id="height" name="height" value="2,5" inputmode="decimal" aria-describedby="height-error"/><span>m</span></div><span class="error" id="height-error"></span></div>
<div><label for="climate">Zona climática orientativa</label><select id="climate" name="climate"><option value="mild">Suave · base 100 frig/h·m²</option><option value="warm" selected>Cálida · base 125 frig/h·m²</option><option value="hot">Muy cálida · base 150 frig/h·m²</option></select></div>
<div><label for="orientation">Orientación principal</label><select id="orientation" name="orientation"><option value="N">Norte</option><option value="E">Este</option><option value="S" selected>Sur</option><option value="O">Oeste</option></select></div>
<div><label for="insulation">Aislamiento</label><select id="insulation" name="insulation"><option value="good">Bueno</option><option value="average" selected>Medio</option><option value="poor">Deficiente</option></select></div>
<div><label for="glass">Superficie acristalada</label><div class="input-wrap"><input id="glass" name="glass" value="5" inputmode="decimal" aria-describedby="glass-error"/><span>m²</span></div><span class="error" id="glass-error"></span></div>
<div><label for="people">Personas habituales</label><div class="input-wrap"><input id="people" name="people" value="2" inputmode="numeric" aria-describedby="people-error"/><span>personas</span></div><span class="error" id="people-error"></span></div>
<div><label for="internalW">Cargas internas relevantes</label><div class="input-wrap"><input id="internalW" name="internalW" value="200" inputmode="decimal" aria-describedby="internalW-error"/><span>W</span></div><span class="error" id="internalW-error"></span></div>
</div><p class="help">La zona no es una zona climática oficial del CTE: selecciona un escenario orientativo. Las cargas internas deben ser las que quieras sumar (equipos, iluminación u otras fuentes de calor).</p><div class="actions"><button class="button" type="submit">Calcular potencia</button><button class="button secondary" type="reset">Restablecer</button></div></form><section class="card result"><p class="eyebrow">TU ESTIMACIÓN</p><h2>Potencia de refrigeración</h2><div id="result-output" aria-live="polite"><p>Revisa los datos y pulsa «Calcular potencia».</p></div></section></div><script>import '../lib/calculator-ui.mjs';</script>